> [!NOTE]
> `weighted_recyclability_index` (WRI) is computed as: Σ(mass_fraction × recyclability_class_score) / total_mass, where Class A=1.0, B=0.6, C=0.2. This is the key KPI for circular economy reporting dashboards.

